# ❌ A movable bridge without an operating mechanism (cross-property SPARQL).
@prefix def: <https://example.org/def/> .
@prefix eb:  <https://example.org/id/example-bridge/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
eb:SwingBridge a def:Bridge ; def:movable true .
    # no def:hasOperatingMechanism
